  "version": 1,
  "title": "Bounded Fubini in algebraically closed valued fields",
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of Forey and Yin's Theorem 5.17. For two definable maps to a common mixed VF/RV base, parameter-definable RV lifts of every pair of fibres with equal bounded residue-field evaluations imply equal bounded invariants of the total VF classes. The saturated canonical equicharacteristic-zero model and small generated-ground hypotheses are explicit. The submission selection contains this one theorem; necessary definition helpers may accompany its vocabulary.",
